From 00539d122a48575f4306662eca91bc8adc054436 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammed <91819504+mohammed7s@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:07:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Screen automation: centralize assistant and searchable target
 switches

Show the selected assistant and its owner switch, with searchable installed target rows and inline switches. All entry routes lead to the same page; per-target system consent remains separate. Query server-side target eligibility without granting access.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
